      "text": "# Taking Flight with Udaan \ud83d\ude80 | Mandar Marathe \u00b7 LinkedIn \u00b7 2025-07-09\n\n**Mandar Marathe**: Vice President Marketing at UPTIQ for 1 year 7 months with 20 years 11 months of total professional experience. Previous roles include Co-Founder at Koppr, Visiting Faculty for Digital Marketing at Indian Institute of Management, Sirmaur, and Visiting Faculty for Digital Marketing at Great Lakes Institute of Management. Based in Mumbai, Maharashtra, India [IN].\n\n---\n\nTaking Flight with Udaan \ud83d\ude80\n\nThrilled to share that I\u2019ve officially taken flight with Udaan \u2014 my new Trust Group under the [ASCENT](https://linkedin.com/company/ascentfoundation) Foundation!\n\n[ASCENT](https://linkedin.com/company/ascentfoundation) has been a go-to community for growth-ready entrepreneurs across India, and being part of this curated peer-learning ecosystem of 1000+ founders is both humbling and energizing.\n\nUdaan isn't just a name \u2014 it's a mindset. One that\u2019s rooted in ambition, learning, trust, and growth. I\u2019m incredibly excited to embark on this journey with some amazing entrepreneurs who bring wisdom, curiosity, and authenticity to the table every month.\n\nBig cheers to new perspectives, deeper conversations, and shared growth ahead! \ud83d\udca5\n\nGrateful to be part of this tribe.\n\n\ud83d\udd17 Tagging my incredible co-travelers from Udaan in the comments \ud83d\udc47\n\n![Taking Flight with Udaan \ud83d\ude80 | Mandar Marathe image](https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQGszdtDLX6tzA/feedshare-shrink_800/B4DZftHLUFG8Ak-/0/1752029774189?e=2",
